{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20415",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.5,
      "end_seconds": 3.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.73,
      "end_seconds": 8.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 9.69,
      "end_seconds": 12.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.66,
      "end_seconds": 23.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair. What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 24.56,
      "end_seconds": 29.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a stinging pain. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.69,
      "end_seconds": 34.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Okay, are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.98,
      "end_seconds": 37.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.57,
      "end_seconds": 43.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.73,
      "end_seconds": 47.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "For three days, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.85,
      "end_seconds": 51.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Alright, how frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.7,
      "end_seconds": 57.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Honestly, every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.39,
      "end_seconds": 61.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.9,
      "end_seconds": 73.01,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get redness around it as well. The redness around it? That's been since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.35,
      "end_seconds": 78.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. And trouble breathing, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.7,
      "end_seconds": 82.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any trouble breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.35,
      "end_seconds": 90.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Have you noticed burn on the face, fever, pus or numbness at the burn?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.31,
      "end_seconds": 96.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.61,
      "end_seconds": 99.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.58,
      "end_seconds": 103.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.35,
      "end_seconds": 109.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.16,
      "end_seconds": 111.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.43,
      "end_seconds": 136.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Alright, tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions. Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.43,
      "end_seconds": 139.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "I have heart failure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.97,
      "end_seconds": 141.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.22,
      "end_seconds": 148.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "I have arthritis in my knees, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.09,
      "end_seconds": 153.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.65,
      "end_seconds": 158.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.88,
      "end_seconds": 163.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.96,
      "end_seconds": 168.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.28,
      "end_seconds": 174.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.05,
      "end_seconds": 178.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.33,
      "end_seconds": 182.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.6,
      "end_seconds": 195.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.72,
      "end_seconds": 218.37,
      "duration_seconds": 11.65,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 110 over 71, weight 88 kilos, heart rate 72, height 165 centimetres, respiratory rate 14, temperature 36.4, SpO2 97 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.75,
      "end_seconds": 225.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.58,
      "end_seconds": 229.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Alright, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.16,
      "end_seconds": 249.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "There is a five-centimetre area of redness with an intact blister on the left forearm, and it blanches and is painful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.31,
      "end_seconds": 253.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.63,
      "end_seconds": 284.37,
      "duration_seconds": 12.74,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably a superficial partial-thickness burn. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.28,
      "end_seconds": 287.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.8,
      "end_seconds": 321.13,
      "duration_seconds": 30.33,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a superficial partial-thickness burn. For this, paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. That should help with burn pain. Cool the area under running water for twenty minutes and cover it with a non-stick dressing, and leave the blister alone. One warning sign to remember: the burn becomes smelly, spreads or you get a fever. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.74,
      "end_seconds": 326.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.89,
      "end_seconds": 334.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Come back if it becomes more painful or smelly. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.7,
      "end_seconds": 337.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.56,
      "end_seconds": 340.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}